.el .ds Aq '
.TH tapectl-unit-list 1  "tapectl-unit-list " 
.SH NAME
tapectl\-unit\-list \- List units
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtapectl unit list\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-tenant\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-status\fR] [\fB\-t\fR|\fB\-\-tag\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List units
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output in JSON format
.TP
\fB\-\-tenant\fR \fI<TENANT>\fR
Filter by tenant name
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Show what would be done without making changes
.TP
\fB\-\-status\fR \fI<STATUS>\fR
Filter by status
.TP
\fB\-t\fR, \fB\-\-tag\fR \fI<TAG>\fR
Filter by tag
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Enable verbose output
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Skip confirmation prompts
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Path to config file
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
